Cell["4.2 Which components are coupled (analogue of eLaCouplings)", \
"Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"26dd30f7-b6b2-477c-ac6b-ef1134f52fde"],

Cell["\<\
coupledSets[eqs_] := Module[{raw = Table[Union[Cases[eqs[[j]], f[k_][__] :> \
k, Infinity], Cases[eqs[[j]], Derivative[__][f[k_]][__] :> k, Infinity]], {j, \
Length[eqs]}], g},
  g = Graph[Flatten[Table[UndirectedEdge @@@ Subsets[r, {2}], {r, raw}]]]; \
Sort[Sort /@ ConnectedComponents[g]]];
couplingsx0x4 = coupledSets[eLax0x4c]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8799a7e0-8596-404f-af98-4688c0e3f2ff"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "5", ",", "8", ",", "13"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", "4", ",", "9", ",", "12"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "7", ",", "10", ",", "15"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", "6", ",", "11", ",", "14"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[15]=",ExpressionUUID->"f0dfccd4-f109-4fb3-a438-5f63fb6b268f"],

Cell["\<\
The coupling pattern {{0,5,8,13},{1,4,9,12},{2,7,10,15},{3,6,11,14}} is \
exactly the pattern eLaCouplings found in Pre-gravity6plane.nb: for \
configurations depending on x0 and x4, dirac16complex decomposes into four \
independent 4-component systems.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"93ec1229-a73e-4dd3-90ee-9fb213713320"],

Cell["\<\
4.3 The variables z = 6 H x0, t = H x4 (analogue of eLazt) and the general \
exponential solution\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"8c630b95-354c-4427-b618-3ee643728065"],

Cell["\<\
With z = 6 H x0 and t = H x4 the linear equation becomes 6 T^0 d_z psi + T^4 \
d_t psi = (m/H) psi. A mode Exp[p z + q t] u solves it iff (6 p T^0 + q T^4 - \
m/H) u = 0, which is possible iff (6p)^2 - q^2 = (m/H)^2, i.e. (6p + q)(6p - \
q) = (m/H)^2. Writing 6p + q = 2C, the exponent is C (t + z/6) - (M^2/(C \
H^2)) (t - z/6) with m = -2M: this is EXACTLY the family of exponential \
solutions that Maple produced in Pre-gravity6plane.nb ('Solution 15feb'). \
Imaginary p, q give oscillatory plane waves (the generic case for a complex \
field).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c023b93e-21b4-4900-a71c-9b02ab2eb33b"],

Cell["\<\
modeLC[CC_, w_] := Module[{p = (CC + M^2/(CC H^2))/6, q = CC - M^2/(CC H^2)},
   (* solves 6 T^0 d_z psi + T^4 d_t psi + (2M/H) psi = 0  because \
(6pT0+qT4+2M/H)(6pT0+qT4-2M/H) = (36p^2-q^2-4M^2/H^2) I = 0 *)
   Exp[p z + q t] (6 p T16A[0] + q T16A[4] - 2 M/H ID16).w];
wGen = Table[1 + k, {k, 0, 15}];
solLC = modeLC[CC, wGen];
Simplify[6 T16A[0].D[solLC, z] + T16A[4].D[solLC, t] - (-2 M/H) solLC] == \
ConstantArray[0, 16]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[16]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a522d643-106d-432d-98f8-fa4100d7b385"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[16]=",ExpressionUUID->"b21e4537-f2da-417a-b5b3-be21ffa29804"],

Cell["\<\
(* oscillatory plane-wave mode of dirac16complex (depending on x0, x4) in the \
original coordinates:  psi = Exp[I (k x0 - En x4)] (I k T^0 - I En T^4 + m) w \
,  En = +-Sqrt[k^2+m^2] *)
modeFunction[k_, mm_, w_, sgnE_ : 1] := With[{En = sgnE Sqrt[k^2 + mm^2]}, \
Exp[I (k x0 - En x4)] (I k T16A[0] - I En T16A[4] + mm ID16).w];
Table[Simplify[T16A[0].D[modeFunction[3/4, 1, wGen, s], x0] + \
T16A[4].D[modeFunction[3/4, 1, wGen, s], x4] - 1 modeFunction[3/4, 1, wGen, \
s]] == ConstantArray[0, 16], {s, {1, -1}}]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[17]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5ff2d045-5ea2-48cc-b39a-a69a5f3b955c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"True", ",", "True"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[17]=",ExpressionUUID->"737561d7-88da-40f3-ae01-9adbea47f597"],

Cell["\<\
4.4 Retarded and advanced (light-cone) variables, and light-like quanta\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d3991f16-546f-4f35-b70e-a3f920294b33"],

Cell["\<\
As in Pre-gravity6plane.nb: ztadv = 6t + z, ztret = 6t - z (equivalently \
xiadv = x0 - x4, xiret = x0 + x4). For m = 0 the solutions depend on one \
light-cone variable only (e.g. on x0 - x4). For them every component of the \
U(1) current J^A = I psibar T^A psi and the scalar psibar psi vanish \
identically, because u = I k (T^0 - T^4) w with (T^0 - T^4)^2 = 0: exactly as \
the bilinears psi.sigma16.psi etc. vanished for the light-like quanta of \
Pre-gravity6plane.nb. These are the light-like quanta of dirac16complex.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a9285279-4e6f-4944-b17b-f272a6d1e42c"],

Cell["\<\
lightLike = Exp[I kk (x0 - x4)] (I kk T16A[0] - I kk T16A[4]).wGen;      (* m \
= 0, depends only on x0 - x4 *)
scalarBil[ps_] := Simplify[Conjugate[ps].sigma16.ps, {kk, x0, x4} \\[Element] \
Reals];
Jcur[ps_] := Table[Simplify[I Conjugate[ps].sigma16.T16A[A].ps, {kk, x0, x4} \
\\[Element] Reals], {A, 0, 7}];
<|\"solves the massless equation\" -> (Simplify[T16A[0].D[lightLike, x0] + \
T16A[4].D[lightLike, x4]] == ConstantArray[0, 16]), \"current J^A\" -> \
Jcur[lightLike], \"psibar psi\" -> scalarBil[lightLike]|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[18]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8b5f00cb-d467-457b-b2a5-45008847ddbc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"solves the massless equation\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"current J^A\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", 
      "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"psibar psi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "0"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[18]=",ExpressionUUID->"aec10c1a-200f-433f-bb35-4e984ac3f640"],

Cell["\<\
4.5 Triality frames and the vector forms of the type-1 and type-2 halves\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"755c7120-9020-4ff6-8d48-6410fec3e0f4"],

Cell["\<\
Exactly as in Pre-gravity6plane.nb: the unit spinor is the 8th normalized \
eigenvector of sigma, unit = (1,0,0,0,1,0,0,0)/Sqrt[2]; the frames are F_A^a \
with columns eta_AA tau[A].unit and F_a^A with rows unit.sigma.taubar[A]; \
vectorFormOfType2 = F_a^A . psi2 and vectorFormOfType1 = \
eta4488.(psi1.sigma.F_A^a), where psi1 = components 0..7 (type 1) and psi2 = \
components 8..15 (type 2).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5da07430-2ff4-42cf-91b9-133ba3f2d6ad"],

Cell["\<\
{evalues, evecs} = Eigensystem[sigma];
UU = ExpandAll[(1/Sqrt[2]) evecs]; unit = UU[[8]];
FAa = Transpose[Table[eta4488[[A + 1, A + 1]] (tau[A].unit), {A, 0, 7}]];
FaA = Table[unit.sigma.taubar[A], {A, 0, 7}];
vectorFormOfType2[psi2_] := FaA.psi2;
vectorFormOfType1[psi1_] := eta4488.(psi1.sigma.FAa);
{unit, unit.sigma.unit, FAa.FaA == ID8, FaA.FAa == ID8}\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[19]:=",ExpressionUUID->"868c9cf0-75c7-4c21-9e56-5a7e0d455d27"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["2"]], ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["2"]], ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", "1", ",", 
   "True", ",", "True"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[19]=",ExpressionUUID->"026bcbc8-f369-4d7d-bc34-83280588d979"],

Cell["4.6 7-planes and the 6-plane M6 created by dirac16complex", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fd9288f7-ea03-49c2-a04f-8158335b5557"],

Cell["\<\
The field equation is REAL, so the real part Re psi of any dirac16complex \
mode depending on x0 and x4 is itself a real solution of the type studied in \
Pre-gravity6plane.nb. Applying the old notebook's construction to it: n1 = \
vectorFormOfType1[Re psi1] and n2 = vectorFormOfType2[Re psi2] are real \
8-vectors depending on (x0, x4); 7-plane k = {Z in R^8 : n_k.Z = 0}; M6 = \
(7-plane 1) intersect (7-plane 2). For a real Psi16 this is literally the \
definition used in Pre-gravity6plane.nb. Generically all 28 = Binomial[8,2] \
coordinate pairs {z_i, z_j} can be solved for (the 28 parameterizations of \
M6).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c2be8285-82c9-4d47-9af4-cc0936bf5bbf"],

Cell["\<\
psiU = modeFunction[3/4, 1, wGen, +1];
reU = ComplexExpand[Re[psiU]];
n1 = Simplify[vectorFormOfType1[reU[[1 ;; 8]]]]; n2 = \
Simplify[vectorFormOfType2[reU[[9 ;; 16]]]];
Zv = Array[z, 8];
minors[a_, b_] := Flatten[Table[Det[{{a[[i]], a[[j]]}, {b[[i]], b[[j]]}}], \
{i, 1, 7}, {j, i + 1, 8}]];
pt = {x0 -> 3/10, x4 -> 7/10};
M6sol = Solve[{(n1 /. pt).Zv == 0, (n2 /. pt).Zv == 0}, {z[7], z[8]}];
<|\"Re psi solves the field equation\" -> (Simplify[T16A[0].D[reU, x0] + \
T16A[4].D[reU, x4] - reU] == ConstantArray[0, 16]),
 \"rank {n1,n2} at sample point\" -> MatrixRank[N[{n1, n2} /. pt]], \"valid \
parameterizations at sample point (of 28)\" -> Count[N[minors[n1, n2] /. pt], \
x_ /; Abs[x] > 10^-12],
 \"M6 at (x0,x4)=(3/10,7/10) solved for {z7,z8}\" -> (M6sol /. (lhs_ -> rhs_) \
:> (lhs -> (Chop[Expand[N[rhs, 8]]] /. z[k_Real] :> z[Round[k]])))|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"196e8386-4ec2-4046-a6d2-b8b06034f4e2"],

